  "solution": {
    "text": "Nine straight lines will intersect at <math><mmultiscripts><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mi></mi><mn>9</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></math> points<br />Five are concurrent at one point so there will be loss of <math><mmultiscripts><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></math> points<br />Four other are concurrent at another point, so there is further loss of <math><mmultiscripts><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></math> points.<br />But we will have these two points at which the lines are concurrect.<br />So, total number of points <math><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn></math>"
